      "card_type": "ADR",
      "description": "Decision: Aurora cards are stored as strict JSON using the .jsjson extension. Rationale: deterministic diffs, wide tool compatibility, and unambiguous machine parsing. Trade-off: no comments; humans must rely on explicit fields and Notes instead.",
